Fuera de cobertura

00:03:42.638 --> 00:03:43.638
<i>Caleb Smith.</i>

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:45.940
Sí.

00:03:46.242 --> 00:03:48.733
<i>Acérquese a la consola
