00:15:50.486 --> 00:15:51.578
Entonces...

00:15:51.654 --> 00:15:52.882
Volviendo al tema.

00:15:55.792 --> 00:15:56.792
Quedaste impresionado.

00:15:57.527 --> 00:15:59.051
Sí. Sí.

00:15:59.862 --> 00:16:01.727
