01:37:56.280 --> 01:37:57.338
¿Ava?

01:38:29.014 --> 01:38:30.072
¡Ava!

01:38:39.958 --> 01:38:41.050
¡Ava!

01:38:43.161 --> 01:38:44.161
¡Ava!

01:40:22.797 --> 01:40:25.493
Bien.
